      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来观摩舞蹈练习时，\n我被天狼星象征硬拉着\n做了双人舞蹈特训！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dcec7913a12583a99f9e8bef120c6c448d4e1600de2c1447cf75d1d5d46c7c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
