    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4baea501f39a50387801c72",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛马娘A",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9e9430bf7526a9a3befdb1bbc497b3d1dd69a6e8a0dd7bb7bf98684f4aee0bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0090/storytimeline_830090003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ba78d7ca343d8770c48eb35",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呃……啊！就选这一首吧！\n这首可以一个人轮流跟两位舞伴跳舞！\n──我要放啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0a1e5c37636d47c41e5e6c738becfb5ed6e816f2535f147fc485b4382c17edb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0090/storytimeline_830090003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0d4220e65142a3c5d50598e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "音乐开始播放，两位完美地领舞。\n周围观摩的学生们\n发出热烈的欢呼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e819ebb899c58f9cb6e131b2093a62acf1dccee9905a62d296585eb67f749e37",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0090/storytimeline_830090003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ca91fa4823233dc4d9ac1d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征的领舞方式\n虽然有些强硬，\n但绝不会不顾舞伴的感受。",
      "source_fingerprint": "841cc65cc7d251addf3e4931099af05e2cf2ad3dce0b8dc686e16ab7ff33e830",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0090/storytimeline_830090003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:776af55abe9961d5695d0ed9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的舞蹈就像炙热的火焰，\n把人带进自己的步调。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10a923299513fa0cf1bf8f761a46a3ac11dc2d09686832b548865b80f983a94e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0090/storytimeline_830090003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5025892383897d0311f8ade",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec317440b52f89fbdfad76110a7afc3ac55b01c91d67997968e5ba969bc9ea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0090/storytimeline_830090003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48bc9ba80b62954f7f25ddd8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你在跟我跳舞，不要转移目光。\n──把头抬起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68a9f86327a5ef8be0cfea5fc628aca15b690edf148a97e0445d7b7bb64903c4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0090/storytimeline_830090003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e77ec1616e6b9e85d3c02d3f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "相较之下，鲁道夫象征\n则是依舞伴的步调起舞，\n展现出优雅高尚的舞姿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1adf932ccb7d824786209c129e59e659142d9b04a50f1e0df3e3767720832002",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0090/storytimeline_830090003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d47bd5954ac8d54504afee40",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的舞蹈就像一股清流，\n让人想将自己交付在安稳的步调中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a5797522ac900ab6c5ad8e3ad6732d121d2506919b5d9df19e6ab950f0b8b6a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
